// Active skills: what a press of a place on the bar does, and the statuses
// some of them put on their user. A member knows an ability through a box
// (`Grant`), slots it on a bar of `bar.weapon` places per weapon class and
// `bar.utility` places that stay, and presses it. It costs stamina, starts
// its cooldown at the press and commits the actor for `length` seconds.
//
// Statuses: what a status does, from a fixed set of fields, each left out
// when it does nothing. `tight_cone`: the bearer's cone is its aimed cone at
// its tightest, moving or not, aiming or not, with no bloom. `posture_taken`:
// a factor on the posture damage the bearer takes. `damage_taken`: a factor
// on the damage the bearer takes, after any guard. `says` is the one line a
// card shows. `pace`: a share of the bearer's moving speed (walking; the
// travel of a cut or a dodge is not scaled, and a sprint is not kept, as
// with any pace under 1). `shield_locked`: the shield does
// not recover while it lasts, and its wait starts over when it ends.
// `disarmed`: the bearer can begin no shot, no cut and no ability, but may
// move, dodge, guard, reload and swap. `reflects`: a bolt the bearer's guard
// blocks or parries is sent back at its shooter with that share of its damage
// and posture, once.
//
// Abilities:
//   slot: Weapon (a place of the class in hand) or Utility (any weapon).
//   works_with: the classes it may be slotted for and used with; for a
//     utility, the classes it needs in hand, empty for any.
//   stamina, cooldown (seconds), windup (seconds before the effect),
//   length (seconds of the whole commitment, at least the windup), cancel
//   (seconds after which a dodge may cut it short), pace (the share of
//   walking speed kept during it).
//   armed: the trigger fires as usual during the commitment.
//   effect:
//     Cut(action)   begins that cut by its own row in actions.ron; the
//                   ability's stamina, windup, length, cancel and pace are
//                   left out, only its cooldown is its own.
//     Shot(rounds, gap, cone, damage, posture, bloom, and the optional
//          on_hit, jump, blast, breach)
//                   at the windup's end the weapon fires `rounds` bolts, `gap`
//                   seconds apart, each taking a round of the magazine;
//                   cone is Aimed (the weapon's aimed cone whatever the
//                   stance) or Exact (none); damage and posture are factors on
//                   the weapon's own; bloom false means the bolts neither
//                   read nor add bloom. Hip is the weapon's hip cone as it
//                   stands (its bloom too when bloom is true).
//                   on_hit(status, seconds): put on whoever a bolt hits and
//                   is not guarded against (a blocked, parried or broken
//                   hit carries none); a bolt at falloff's far end carries
//                   it whole, only its damage is a share.
//                   jump(radius, share): on its first hit on a hostile the
//                   bolt strikes the nearest other living hostile within
//                   `radius` metres, once, at `share` of its damage and
//                   posture, if a line of sight reaches it (a wall in the
//                   way means no jump, not the next nearest); the jump
//                   never returns to the first and carries no status.
//                   blast(radius, damage, posture): at the first contact,
//                   with an actor or the world, every living hostile within
//                   `radius` metres takes that blow once, the one struck
//                   included, never the user or its side.
//                   breach: the bolt empties what is left of its target's
//                   shield before its damage is counted.
//     Strike(reach, arc, damage, posture)
//                   at the windup's end everything hostile within `reach`
//                   metres and `arc` degrees either side of the facing takes
//                   that blow once, as a cut does. `scaled`: reach is a
//                   factor on the weapon in hand's and damage and posture
//                   factors on its class's light cut, so one row serves two
//                   classes. `on_hit` as a Shot has it.
//     Hit(damage, posture, status, seconds)
//                   one attack with whatever is in hand that puts a status on
//                   what it lands on unguarded: with a gun one aimed bolt, a
//                   round of the magazine, factors on the weapon's own; with
//                   a melee weapon a scaled strike at the weapon's reach in
//                   the `hit_arc` below, factors on the light cut.
//     Move(distance, seconds, along, then, cover)
//                   from the windup's end the user is carried `distance`
//                   metres over `seconds` by the character step (a wall or
//                   a body stops it), along Aim (the facing at the press) or
//                   Input (the way being walked, else the facing); `then` is
//                   a strike landed where the movement ends or is stopped.
//                   `cover` (arc, share): while the movement lasts a bolt
//                   from within `arc` degrees either side of its direction
//                   is met as a block that takes `share` of its damage and
//                   all of its posture, at no stamina; a Reflecting user
//                   returns it as any blocked bolt.
//                   The length is at least the windup plus the seconds.
//     Own(what)     at the windup's end, on the user: Reload, Shield (the
//                   shield's wait before it recovers ends now) or
//                   Status(id, seconds). With a length of nought it is
//                   instant: paid, cooled down and applied in the tick of
//                   the press, committing the user to nothing (no other
//                   effect may have a length of nought).
(
    version: 5,
    bar: (weapon: 3, utility: 2),
    // The arc in degrees of the strike a Hit makes with a melee weapon.
    hit_arc: 40.0,
    statuses: [
        (
            id: "focused",
